[10.99543, "o", "Done. Files are in `/work`:\r\n\r\n- **`calc/__init__.py`**: `add(a, b, c=0)` returns `a + b + c`. It started as `add(a, b)` and I changed it with an edit.\r\n- **`tests/test_calc.py`**: four pytest tests:\r\n  - `test_add_positive_numbers`: `add(2, 3) == 5`\r\n  - `test_add_negative_numbers`: `add(-4, -6) == -10`\r\n  - `test_add_with_third_argument`: `add(1, 2, 3) == 6`\r\n  - `test_add_third_argument_defaults_to_zero`: `add(1, 2) == add(1, 2, 0) == 3`\r\n\r\nAll 4 tests pass. `python` isn't on the PATH here, so I ran them with `python3 -m pytest`.\r\n"]
